        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "LOTAD is said to have dwelled on land\nbefore. However, this POKéMON is\nthought to have returned to water\fbecause the leaf on its head grew large\nand heavy. It now lives by floating\natop the water.",
